14 it closed at $15.89, its first close above the base high of $15.79. Volume that day was 4.4M shares, 0.65x the prior 10-day average of 6.9M. It didn't hold. By Jan 6, 2015 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $17.02.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}